  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can effortlessly catch yourself when falling while climbing.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sure Grasp<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a bonus equal to your mythic tier on Climb checks and Reflex saves made to avoid falling damage or to catch yourself when falling. If you fall, you can expend one or more uses of mythic power to reduce falling damage by an amount equal to your mythic tier, and one-half of this damage is nonlethal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc100\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
